a:2:{s:7:"content";s:548:"<p>A delegation of Chinese companies representing Mining &amp; Processing Machinery visited our zonal office in Mardan, KP, to explore investment prospects and bilateral cooperation in Marble &amp; Granite Mining and processing. Asghar Khan Chairman APMIA, accompanied by Wisal khan President MIA, and other zone leaders, extended a warm welcome, assuring complete cooperation. Additionally, APMIA enthusiastically invites all international investors to consider Pakistan for investment opportunities, promising unwavering support from our end.</p>";s:12:"content_meta";N;}